i": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_683890534781612_1845730143550472367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GXBq2u1_94UQ7kNvwGLeQtl&_nc_oc=AdqEeCGvZYuye-F4IzYXF3BL7uFtxuzTni7iEUkyunBF_BY1WtLfSvZrdomjdn5EbC8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwCpezoTGHXH4pe682OWl3jW0USVSXrI5SqhwRikcLfig&oe=69D123A4"}, {"file_name": "3 SC- upgrade.png", "id": "1089105139847913", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1089105146514579_4248858233085192791_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x2grXCzHo1EQ7kNvwG4qo-l&_nc_oc=AdoNjsO0Hfigohpmn8YCkmy-GJxfFqmMgL0Y6XxRzQ09S29BGOqXo_RAlSbr1sKH9KQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxWZT5tpzgydfKcqxDEFZx8zEmU8E5RQ8ZDMsnuz8dYeg&oe=69D1072C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_03_Combat.png", "id": "910125081636304", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_910125084969637_8062525329240909942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lzFBgUobliMQ7kNvwGIOZnb&_nc_oc=AdqE5ZBWbw-TpNvVoq30NU4vBxyW3_vyDRA1Xm7lKzxOFWtIFAZ2leq4fTWAo67Fn-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwp8wijQ_f3XqLFrl6lMGegAorlzKX7-nLgaIV9OnpFQw&oe=69D1061C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_02_Combat.png", "id": "782108887855752", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_782108891189085_1310893654474811832_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qIkmw13VDdYQ7kNvwFDMS-C&_nc_oc=Ado-5IqN7EmH0B818wHl_aglAM2NuTkvUzlkkPB80TO_T_tbxS8_wTJUQKvJU4s9cm8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxorLbh3CLTfeBQG4gPHGAGkepmMllciHb42yxI6NZEYQ&oe=69D0F99D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "2692830891061149", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2692830894394482_8747474291273843826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=crWmiatprBwQ7kNvwGQq1uR&_nc_oc=AdpSchhjxAMWNqUdVPcEPdNeWdzIAEtJJH7Vp040g62htzYQmxKLUcKZL4LkQYEFk4I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyFTn-f-ZpDY3gZoLutY9O71iML9J153IvazMmhJeolDg&oe=69D0FECF"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Shooter", "roguelike", "Hell", "Demons"], "long_description": "# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{2188548808336788}\n# Become Godlike!\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{747652215014871}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1178417621063675}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1591134325586122}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.\n\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "develop